   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "1997-01-22",
   "text": "Family and Medical Leave Fairness Act of 1997 - Amends the Family and Medical Leave Act of 1993 to extend coverage to employees at worksites where the employer employs at least 25 (currently 50) employees at the worksite and within 75 miles of that worksite."
